findings.remediation:
Use AWS Secrets Manager or AWS Systems Manager Parameter Store to store and retrieve secrets. Update the environment block to reference the secret from the secure store. Example:
```hcl
environment {
  variables = {
    access_key = aws_secretsmanager_secret_version.my_secret.data["access_key"]
    secret_key = aws_secretsmanager_secret_version.my_secret.data["secret_key"]
  }
}
```
Ensure to create the corresponding `aws_secretsmanager_secret` and `aws_secretsmanager_secret_version` resources.
